<title>INDIA: India PAL in tie-up with Magnetti Marelli.</title>
<headline>India PAL in tie-up with Magnetti Marelli.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian car-maker Premier Automobiles (PAL) on Tuesday said it will form a joint venture with Italian auto component group Magnetti Marelli.  </p>
<p>The Indian company in a statement said the joint venture with the Italian firm, part of the Fiat group, will be for development, manufacture and sale of auto components.</p>
<p>Both firms are scheduled to announce more details at a joint press briefing in Bombay on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
